</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F3.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S4.F3.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Persona A (Skincare)</span></figcaption>
