</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.sf2.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="55.23" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 55.23" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.23) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FBE5BA;" fill="#FBE5BA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 8.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.06em;--ltx-fo-height:2.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="41.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 39.94)" width="581.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
