</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.sf2.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="52.67" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 52.67" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,52.67) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 44.37 C 0 48.95 3.72 52.67 8.3 52.67 L 469.07 52.67 C 473.66 52.67 477.38 48.95 477.38 44.37 L 477.38 8.3 C 477.38 3.72 473.66 0 469.07 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DCEBFA;" fill="#DCEBFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 44.37 C 0 48.95 3.72 52.67 8.3 52.67 L 469.07 52.67 C 473.66 52.67 477.38 48.95 477.38 44.37 L 477.38 8.3 C 477.38 3.72 473.66 0 469.07 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 8.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.06em;--ltx-fo-height:2.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="39.26" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 37.38)" width="581.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
