<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-user" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic3.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[P2]:Probably 1TB or higher. I already have a few USBs lying around, so I’m more interested in external hard drives or maybe high-end SD cards if they’re fast enough.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.sf2.pic4" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="55.23" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 55.23" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.23) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FBE5BA;" fill="#FBE5BA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 8.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.06em;--ltx-fo-height:2.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="41.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 39.94)" width="581.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:42.06em;">
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-robot" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic4.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic4.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Great, that’s helpful. Do you have a preferred price range in mind? And are there any brands you trust or have used before for storage?</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.sf2.pic5" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="52.67" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 52.67" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,52.67) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 44.37 C 0 48.95 3.72 52.67 8.3 52.67 L 469.07 52.67 C 473.66 52.67 477.38 48.95 477.38 44.37 L 477.38 8.3 C 477.38 3.72 473.66 0 469.07 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DCEBFA;" fill="#DCEBFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 44.37 C 0 48.95 3.72 52.67 8.3 52.67 L 469.07 52.67 C 473.66 52.67 477.38 48.95 477.38 44.37 L 477.38 8.3 C 477.38 3.72 473.66 0 469.07 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 8.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.06em;--ltx-fo-height:2.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="39.26" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 37.38)" width="581.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:42.06em;">
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block fas fa-user" aria-hidden="true">
</span>
<span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic5.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F3.sf2.pic5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[P2]: Under $100 if possible. I’ve used SanDisk and Toshiba before and had a good experience. I’m open to similar brands that are reliable and well-reviewed.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.sf2.pic6" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="55.23" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 55.23" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,55.23) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FBE5BA;" fill="#FBE5BA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 49.69 C 0 52.75 2.48 55.23 5.53 55.23 L 471.84 55.23 C 474.9 55.23 477.38 52.75 477.38 49.69 L 477.38 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 8.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:42.06em;--ltx-fo-height:2.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.14em;font-size:10pt;" height="41.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 39.94)" width="581.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
